Z||000003||MinnGreenGT||10-25-2001||09:29 PM||||pick up nitrous at <A HREF="http://www.nitrouswarehouse.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.nitrouswarehouse.com</A>   They carry nitrous NX kits (the best in the industry... ask 1FST2M6   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)<P>Nothing stock has the 2.8 turbo or supercharger.  I believe that <A HREF="http://www.design1systems.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.design1systems.com</A>  (think that's right...) has a turbo kit.  And the member Turbo88 is currently developing a turbo kit (seach the mall from the past week or two).  Also the memeber TriAd is developing a supercharger kit using an Eaton blower (search general from the past week).<P>Good luck! (oh yeah, for lot's of power, also check out <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com</A>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<P>------------------<BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 10-25-2001).]||||reg||1
