Z||000025||Slammed Fiero||10-31-2001||10:24 AM||||Didn't realize this was still going. Checked my PM this morning and had 6 PM's from 6 Different people who want to buy it.<P>3 who had already told me they wanted it then backed out. (this sorta stuff pisses me off) One was  last week.. told me he sent the cheque out by express post...friday comes not here. I ask him..Ohh It will be there...Monday he emails me..Ahhh I can't afford it sorry. Another guy said he would give me 2 sets of GT wheels for it and $100? I have no use for the GT wheels at all. Then when I said no , he flipped. Someone wanted to trade a TV , another person asked if he could pay $20 a week on it, but of course he wanted it now.<P>So yes I still have it , it's still in the car. No I won't trade anyone for anything, Don't need anything. If I do decide to sell it, I'm not taking it outof the car until I have money in hand.<P>Let me think about this and get back to you all tonight. I hope you can understand my aprehension in selling. <P>it's 10:00 AM right now.<P>JM <p>[This message has been edited by Slammed Fiero (edited 10-31-2001).]||||reg||1
